### StockSense API playground (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
@base = http://localhost:4000/api

# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "manager@stocksense.dev", "password": "Demo@1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/products?stock=low
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# Receive 100 kg of steel into the main warehouse (creates a draft)
POST {{base}}/operations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "receipt", "warehouse_id": 1, "partner": "Tata Steel", "lines": [{ "product_id": 1, "quantity": 100 }] }

###
# Validate it (replace 21 with the id returned above)
POST {{base}}/operations/21/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/moves?product_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
